@startuml
[*] --> Created account : User creates an account
Created account --> Logged in : User logs in to their existing account
Logged in --> Registration failed : Registration is not successful
Logged in --> Valid location entered : New location entered is valid
Valid location entered --> Weather information selected : User chooses what to check
Weather information selected --> Additional weather details viewed : User views additional weather details
Additional weather details viewed --> Session ended (logged out) : User logs out
Registration failed --> [*] : Registration not successful
Invalid location entered --> Logged in : New location entered is invalid
Valid location entered --> Invalid location entered : Location changed (current or another)
Weather information selected --> Valid location entered : No weather information available for the selected location
Additional weather details viewed --> Valid location entered : No data available for the selected location
Session ended (logged out) --> [*] : Session timed out

@enduml
